.TH CHTTP_FORM_BODY 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
CHTTP_FORM_BODY \- construct a chttp_request_body_t for URL-encoded form content
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttp.h>

CHTTP_FORM_BODY(d, n)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Expands to a chttp_request_body_t initialiser with Content-Type set to
"application/x-www-form-urlencoded", data pointer d, and byte length n.
The caller is responsible for percent-encoding the key/value pairs
before passing them to this macro.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR CHTTP_JSON_BODY (3),
.BR CHTTP_BODY (3)
